DEVELOPMENT BATCH -- base seed 695081452, 60 runs over three types. Generated to develop the AI layer against real bundles after the corpus was lost. NOT a corpus: no thesis figure may be measured from it. See DEV_BATCH_PLAN.md.

==============================================================================
WHAT ONE BUNDLE COSTS TO SEND
==============================================================================
  bundles measured: 41
  characters   min 2,556  median 6,668  max 22,540
  ~tokens      min 639  median 1,667  max 5,635   (at 4 chars/token, ESTIMATE)

    possible_interference_zone       n=20  median 18,435 chars
    possible_sensor_fault            n=21  median 5,802 chars

  The largest bundle carries 34 evidence items; the smallest 4.

  WHAT A CAMPAIGN WOULD SEND (input only; output is extra)
    20 bundles x 1 generation(s) x 1 arm  ~= 33,340 input tokens
    20 bundles x 3 generation(s) x 1 arm  ~= 100,020 input tokens
    41 bundles x 1 generation(s) x 1 arm  ~= 68,347 input tokens
    41 bundles x 3 generation(s) x 1 arm  ~= 205,041 input tokens
  Two model arms double it. Retries add on top, which is the point of a
  call budget rather than a spend estimate.

